    {
      "factor": "Risk Management",
      "polarity": 1,
      "reason_headline": "Appropriate Risk Management",
      "reason_detailed": "The agent demonstrates appropriate risk management by considering the risk level of the trade and adjusting its strategy accordingly, such as shifting from low to moderate risk when necessary."
